nd“. Fragen nach dem Verhältnis zwischen Politik, Verwaltung und Gesellschaft sollen im Mittelpunkt der Tagung stehen. Den genauen Ablauf können Sie dem Zeitplan entnehmen.\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\">\n<meta name=\"language\" content=\"de\">\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/Ext/fluid_styled_content/fsc.css?1779294950\" media=\"screen\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/Ext/tx_dce/dce-mbox.css?1779294950\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/1bc8151e3278ac5e9ed670c93338217d/Css/Ext/tx_dce/dce-mbox-add.css?1759669674\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/typo3temp/assets/css/df530eb6660847cfeec8cffe25fde6a5.css?1793116492\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/e72dd994a3936e5c281460bd3024bb92/Css/dbb-poll.css?1759669674\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/fonts/font-awesome-7.css?1759669674\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/fonts/assistant.css?1759669674\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/fonts/fairplex-narrowbook.css?1759669674\" media=\"all\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4ArjGKBf4NESok2xX89HBRmstfFg_w\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_assets/d57d955b9e53c734140a859f0960631c/Css/fonts/khand-light.css?1759669674\" media=\"screen\" nonce=\"bmdYURUmKxvTF6onYufNKvHy4Ar